    "body": "## Summary\n\n- fix three grammar errors in BIP 441\n- correct the v0.2.1 changelog year from 2023 to 2026\n\nThe original v0.2.1 revision was authored on 2026-03-27, confirming that `2023-03-27` was a typo.\n\n## Checks\n\n- `scripts/link-format-chk.sh`\n- `scripts/diffcheck.sh`\n- `typos`",
